==='''Chapter 3'''===
Despite the low Cat Limit, this stage is very simple. The only real threat here is a single Mesocosmocyclone, which can easily be stalled with [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] or [[Miter Saw Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Neo Saw Cat]]. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] with his [[Explosion]] [[Talents|Talent]] can also rush this stage with minimal support.

